        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PP3515, Solid Brass 3.5\" x 15\" Door Push Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size door push plates primarily used in restaurants, warehouses and stores, but are popular in homes as well. Made of .050\" thick high quality solid brass for longevity. Packaged with matching finish brass mounting screws for easy installation. The Push Plate is 3.5\" wide and 15\" long. It is available in 10 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PP3515-Specifications.gif?v=1704354687\" width=\"430\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" atl=\"3.5 x 15 Solid Brass Push Plate Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-3-1-2-by-15-pull-plate-with-handle-deltana-pph55\"><b>Matching  Door Pull  and Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-push-plate-3-5-x-20-inch-deltana-pp3520\"><b>Larger 3.5\" x 20\" Push Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-push-plate-3-5-inch-x-15-inch-deltana-pp3515u32d\"><b>3.5\" x 20\"  Stainless Steel Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana PP3515 Door Push Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged With Mounting Screws</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PP3515.pdf?v=1691095373\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PP3515 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
